WEBVTT

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:15.214
It's amazing.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.808
-Terrific party.
-You really outdid yourself, Drac.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.227
Got to be the best one
I've been to in 500 years.

00:00:38.196 --> 00:00:40.531
Sorry, big man.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:02.720
Mavis?

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.639
I'm crazily scared right now.

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.100
Maybe that's a good thing.

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:22.615
How could you?
After I shared my pain with you?

00:01:22.657 --> 00:01:24.325
-But, no...
-Dad, it was just a kiss.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:25.994
No, you're not allowed to kiss.

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:29.497
Dad, I'm allowed to do things.
I'm not 83 anymore.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:31.791
I'm allowed to like people,
or go see the world again.

00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:34.502
What? You saw it! You said you didn't like it!

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.462
Maybe I want to give
the village another chance.

00:01:36.504 --> 00:01:39.382
I just need to learn, you know,
just how to roll with it, like Johnny does.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.510
No, no, you can't go to the village again.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.095
Maybe you can make them see
that we could be friends.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.638
No, that isn't possible.

00:01:45.763 --> 00:01:47.974
Well, you can't be sure.
It's all in how you present yourself.

00:01:48.016 --> 00:01:49.934
-No, that won't make a difference!
-How do you know?

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:51.019
-Because it just won't!
-Why? Why won't it?

00:01:51.269 --> 00:01:53.688
Because that village doesn't really exist!

00:01:58.776 --> 00:02:01.487
What do you mean "doesn't exist"?

00:02:01.612 --> 00:02:03.448
What did you do?

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:05.825
I did what I had to do.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.035
What was it?

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:10.788
What exactly did you have to do? Tell me!

00:02:12.457 --> 00:02:17.879
I... I built the town.
The staff put it all together.

00:02:18.004 --> 00:02:21.924
The zombies dressed up
as the townspeople.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.054
Please.

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:29.390
If you really went out there
and something happened to you,

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:32.060
I just couldn't live with myself.

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:36.355
But you can live with this? Lying to me?
Tricking me?

00:02:36.397 --> 00:02:39.567
Keeping me here forever when
you knew my dream was to go.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.029
Liar! Liar!

00:02:43.946 --> 00:02:45.073
Oil?

00:02:48.826 --> 00:02:50.369
English, please.

00:02:50.411 --> 00:02:52.497
Your voice is really annoying.

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:54.082
Wait, I speak frozen.

00:02:54.207 --> 00:02:57.710
He says, "Dracula has brought
a human into the hotel."

00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:01.005
-A human?
-Stay close, pookie!

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:06.052
He says, "There is ze human."

00:03:06.094 --> 00:03:07.553
He has a French accent.

00:03:13.101 --> 00:03:15.895
Johnny's not a human.
He's my right arm's cousin.

00:03:15.937 --> 00:03:17.897
-He's lying.
-Yeah.

00:03:18.106 --> 00:03:19.398
And why is he picking his nose?

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.402
He says, "It's a long story."

00:03:23.569 --> 00:03:25.905
Hey, wait, no! Get off me!

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:31.744
He says, "Behold ze human."

00:03:34.413 --> 00:03:35.915
I don't believe it.

00:03:42.296 --> 00:03:45.424
Is it true? Are you a human?

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:48.594
Yes.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.055
I'm so sorry.

00:03:52.765 --> 00:03:55.768
I don't care. I still want to be with you.

00:04:05.611 --> 00:04:09.949
Well, tough.
'Cause I don't want to be with you.

00:04:09.991 --> 00:04:13.494
Because you're a monster.
And I hate monsters.

00:04:15.454 --> 00:04:17.123
Goodbye.

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:20.126
Please don't hurt me!

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:25.756
This is all your fault!

00:04:27.633 --> 00:04:30.428
-We're getting out of here.
-I'm never coming back here.

00:04:30.469 --> 00:04:34.307
-I thought I smelled a human.
-"Human-free"? What a rip.

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:48.821
Here he comes. Count Crock-ula.

00:04:48.863 --> 00:04:53.159
I'm just glad my eyes are stitched shut,
'cause I don't even want to...

00:04:55.494 --> 00:04:58.372
Mavis, honey, are you in there?

00:05:00.499 --> 00:05:03.169
Mavis? Mavis?

00:05:04.003 --> 00:05:07.173
Mavis, where are you?

00:05:07.298 --> 00:05:09.133
Mavis?

00:05:28.694 --> 00:05:31.739
Dad, can you do me a favor?

00:05:31.948 --> 00:05:35.034
Yes, yes, of course, darling. Anything.

00:05:35.243 --> 00:05:36.869
Will you erase my mind?

00:05:39.497 --> 00:05:45.544
No, no, no, no. No, I won't do that.
There's too much I want you to remember.

00:05:45.628 --> 00:05:49.215
You were right, Dad. The humans hate us.

00:05:49.548 --> 00:05:53.261
Sweetheart, there are so many
eligible monsters out there.

00:05:53.344 --> 00:05:54.679
You're so young to...

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:58.224
What is it? What are you reading?

00:06:05.564 --> 00:06:08.067
"Two lonely bats crashed in the night.

00:06:09.735 --> 00:06:14.198
"They felt a Zing. Love at first sight.

00:06:14.615 --> 00:06:18.619
"They knew right then
they would be husband and wife.

00:06:19.412 --> 00:06:23.916
"For a Zing only happens once in your life.

00:06:24.417 --> 00:06:26.585
"Your Zing will come, my love.

00:06:26.711 --> 00:06:28.087
"Cherish it.

00:06:28.212 --> 00:06:30.339
"Love, Mommy."

00:06:34.218 --> 00:06:38.264
-I thought we Zinged, Dad.
-You and Johnny?

00:06:38.389 --> 00:06:41.100
I guess it was only me.

00:06:41.142 --> 00:06:45.104
But you should be happy, Dad.
There's no reason for me to leave.

00:06:45.271 --> 00:06:49.775
I have no more dreams. I'm just like you now.

